{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/d4_bry5tmmqVcijeXqw7ZQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:39.652225+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/d4_bry5tmmqVcijeXqw7ZQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoiaF1vP7ImlicKdk5ib2kJ0iaMstE58lyX3jSIZ7eibiavzPJTwhfMgicvyMcA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎全国各重点院校的优秀大学生参加安徽医科大学护理学院2025年暑期夏令营。此次活动旨在让您深入了解我院，感受浓厚的学术氛围与专业魅力。我们期待与您共筑梦想，欢迎选择安徽医科大学护理学院深造。请有意者及时关注我院网站信息。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXodWYet5ibS7xz39jCuhNiaRByQnaDIpLJm6qf7gbo0m7Ey4c8QY3CSQkA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>单位简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>安徽医科大学护理教育溯源于1930年创办的附设护士学校，深耕中等护理教育60余年，于1998年启动护理本科教育，开启了多层次办学的序幕。1999年开始招收护理学专业本科生，2007年开始招收护理学硕士研究生，2011年获批为全国首批护理学一级学科科学学位硕士授权点，2014年获批为安徽省首个护理学专业学位硕士授权点，2019年获批临床护理学二级学科博士学位授权点。2022年获批安徽省首批应用型高峰培育学科、留学基金委创新型人才国际合作项目。2024年获批安徽省特色学科立项建设。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025年</span><span><span>7月14日8:00-7月18日17:00</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>计划营员人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营活动计划营员人数</span><span><span>20-30</span></span><span>名，实际入营人数将根据报名情况适当调整。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次活动预计于</span><span><span>7月23日-25日</span></span><span>在安徽医科大学南校区护理学院举行，活动形式为线下进行。</span></p><p><span>7月23日下午报到，7月24日夏令营开幕式、参观学校、学科介绍会、专题讲座，7月25日研招政策解读、经验交流会、优秀营员颁奖、离营。</span></p><p><span>具体以实际通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国各高等学校2026届应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优异，英语水平良好，具有浓厚科研兴趣，有较强的研究能力；</span></p><p><span>4.专业成绩排名和综合素质排名均在本专业名列前茅或有望取得就读学校推荐免试研究生资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.网上报名：具体报名材料如下</span></p><p><span>①《安徽医科大学护理学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（见附件1）及《汇总表》（见附件2）；</span></p><p><span>②外语水平证明，如CET四级、CET六级、雅思、托福等；</span></p><p><span>③本科阶段历年成绩单和专业排名证明（均须由教务部门盖章）各1份，JPG或PDF格式;</span></p><p><span>④有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文 PDF格式、获奖证书扫描件等。</span></p><p><span>所有报名材料按顺序整合为一个电子版（PDF，首页附清单）与报名汇总表电子版（附件2）一起发送至邮箱aydhlkyxkxw@163.com，以“本科毕业学校名称-姓名”命名，逾期发送不予受理，</span></p><p><span>2.资格审核</span></p><p><span>学院将根据申请者提交的材料，以学术水平、科研能力、综合素质等作为主要评价依据进行评审，审核通过后将以邮件形式通知，入选者需要回复“确认参与”和“确认不参与”，未在规定时间内回复确定为自动放弃。未入选者不再另行通知；</span></p><p><span>3.优惠政策</span></p><p><span>表现优异者报考2026年安徽医科大学护理学院硕士研究生，且达到报考专业初试及复试相关要求，同等条件下优先拟录取。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学生食宿及资助安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动开展期间提供工作餐和住宿费（合肥市内高校或家在合肥的学生不安排住宿），交通费营员自理。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.被录取的营员请带好本人的</span><span><span>学生证、身份证</span></span><span>报到；</span></p><p><span>2.本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用，护理学院不承担参加者活动期间所产生的任何法律和经济责任；</span></p><p><span>3.如遇与学校或学院重大事宜冲突，活动将做适当变更，并通过官网发通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系电话：0551-63869181</span></p><p><span>Email:  </span><span><span>aydhlkyxkxw@163.com</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjXqicVxOjODLXasEiadDo0DXoqU8l2libmOtqMokZ3RszCJ2nvQkyVOJwk83IeYpSf2R7ZEUpo8GQApw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>附件：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>附件：</span></p><p><span>附件1:<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/d4_bry5tmmqVcijeXqw7ZQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">安徽医